constraints:
3 <= n <= 10^{3}
1 <= arr[i] <= 10^{3}

expected time complexity: O(n^{2}).
expected auxiliary space: O(1).

standard_solution_code:
class Solution:

	def findNumberOfTriangles(self, arr, n):
		arr.sort()
		ans = 0
		for i in range(n - 1, 0, -1):
			left = 0
			right = i - 1
			while left < right:
				if arr[left] + arr[right] > arr[i]:
					ans += right - left
					right -= 1
				else:
					left += 1
		return ans
